            <p>
              Where {guest ? 'these apps rank' : 'your apps rank'} in <b>Google Play</b> and <b>App Store</b> search — position history,
              movement vs the last check, keyword discovery, and top-chart positions. Checked daily.
            </p>
            <nav class="top">
